 compatibility matrix

Local production changes for Xiaomi 12 (cupid), snapshot 2026-09-14.

     vintf/xiaomi_framework_compatibility_matrix.xml | 10 ++++++++++
     1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
